  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "Paul, an apostle, (not of men, neither by man, but by Jesus Christ, and God the Father, who raised him from the dead;)",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "And all the brethren which are with me, unto the churches of Galatia:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "Grace be to you and peace from God the Father, and from our Lord Jesus Christ,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "Who gave himself for our sins, that he might deliver us from this present evil world, according to the will of God and our Father:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "To whom be glory for ever and ever. Amen.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "I marvel that ye are so soon removed from him that called you into the grace of Christ unto another gospel:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "Which is not another; but there be some that trouble you, and would pervert the gospel of Christ.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "But though we, or an angel from heaven, preach any other gospel unto you than that which we have preached unto you, let him be accursed.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "As we said before, so say I now again, If any man preach any other gospel unto you than that ye have received, let him be accursed.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "For do I now persuade men, or God? or do I seek to please men? for if I yet pleased men, I should not be the servant of Christ.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "But I certify you, brethren, that the gospel which was preached of me is not after man.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "For I neither received it of man, neither was I taught it, but by the revelation of Jesus Christ.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "For ye have heard of my conversation in time past in the Jews’ religion, how that beyond measure I persecuted the church of God, and wasted it:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "And profited in the Jews’ religion above many my equals in mine own nation, being more exceedingly zealous of the traditions of my fathers.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "But when it pleased God, who separated me from my mother’s womb, and called me by his grace,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "To reveal his Son in me, that I might preach him among the heathen; immediately I conferred not with flesh and blood:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "Neither went I up to Jerusalem to them which were apostles before me; but I went into Arabia, and returned again unto Damascus.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "Then after three years I went up to Jerusalem to see Peter, and abode with him fifteen days.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "But other of the apostles saw I none, save James the Lord’s brother.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "Now the things which I write unto you, behold, before God, I lie not.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "Afterwards I came into the regions of Syria and Cilicia;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "And was unknown by face unto the churches of Judaea which were in Christ:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "But they had heard only, That he which persecuted us in times past now preacheth the faith which once he destroyed.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-024",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 24,
      "verseId": "kjv:galatians:1:24",
      "numberLabel": "24",
      "text": "And they glorified God in me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Galatians 1:24",
        "verseKey": "kjv:galatians:1:24"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
